{
 "title": "Chapter 3: The Chains",
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "Chapter 3: The Chains",
   "beats": [
    {
     "id": "s04b01",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "But first, Russia nearly *vanished*.",
     "shot": "c3_vanish",
     "date": 1598,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "whoosh",
       "w:vanished",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b02",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "In 1600, a *volcano* erupted in Peru.",
     "shot": "c3_volcano",
     "date": 1600,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "rumble",
       "w:volcano",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b03",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "It threw ash and sulphur into the sky and *cooled* the climate around the world.",
     "shot": "c3_volcano"
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b04",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "In Russia, harvests *failed*.",
     "shot": "c3_famine",
     "date": 1601,
     "quiet": true,
     "amb": "wind"
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b05",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Famine spread for years, and *millions* died.",
     "shot": "c3_famine",
     "quiet": true,
     "amb": "wind"
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b06",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "The ruling dynasty had also *died* out.",
     "shot": "c3_troubles",
     "date": 1605
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b07",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "*Rival* nobles fought for the throne.",
     "shot": "c3_troubles",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "clang",
       "w:fought",
       0.3
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b08",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "*Pretenders* appeared.",
     "shot": "c3_troubles",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop",
       "w:Pretenders",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b09",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "*Foreign* armies saw their chance.",
     "shot": "c3_troubles",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "drum",
       "w:armies",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b10",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "In 1610, Polish troops occupied the *Kremlin*.",
     "shot": "c3_kremlin",
     "date": 1610,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "thud",
       "w:occupied",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b11",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "A volunteer army led by a merchant and a prince *drove* them out in 1612.",
     "shot": "c3_minin",
     "date": 1612,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "drum",
       "w:volunteer",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b12",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "The next year, a national assembly chose a *16-year-old*, Michael Romanov, as Tsar.",
     "shot": "c3_romanov",
     "date": 1613,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "drum",
       "w:Tsar",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b13",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "His family would rule for more than *300* years.",
     "shot": "c3_romanov",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ding",
       "w:300",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b14",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Now the new dynasty faced a *problem*.",
     "shot": "c3_problem",
     "amb": "birds"
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b15",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Russia had *huge* land and little labour.",
     "shot": "c3_walkaway",
     "amb": "birds"
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b16",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "And a peasant who'd had enough could simply *walk* away into the forest.",
     "shot": "c3_walkaway",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "whoosh",
       "w:forest",
       0.3
      ]
     ],
     "amb": "birds"
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b17",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Landowners needed *workers*.",
     "shot": "c3_needs",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop",
       "w:workers",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b18",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "The state needed *taxes*.",
     "shot": "c3_needs",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "coins",
       "w:taxes",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b19",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "So in 1649, a new legal code *locked* the peasants in place.",
     "shot": "c3_code",
     "date": 1649,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "clang",
       "w:locked",
       0.45
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b20",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Over time, they became *bound* to their landlords' estates.",
     "shot": "c3_code",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "clang",
       "w:bound",
       0.3
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b21",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "And so did their *children*.",
     "shot": "c3_code"
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b22",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "This was *serfdom*, and it lasted for more than two centuries.",
     "shot": "c3_serfdom",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "scribble",
       "w:centuries",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b23",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "*Imagine* being born into it.",
     "shot": "c3_imagine",
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b24",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Your *farm* isn't yours.",
     "shot": "c3_imagine",
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b25",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Your *labour* isn't yours.",
     "shot": "c3_imagine",
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b26",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Your children inherit your *chains*.",
     "shot": "c3_imagine",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "clang",
       "w:chains",
       0.3
      ]
     ],
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s04i01",
     "text": "Bill number one: the *serfs*. Paid in full… for two hundred years.",
     "shot": "in_receipt",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "paper",
       2,
       0.4
      ]
     ],
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b27",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "And the reason isn't *cruelty* for its own sake.",
     "shot": "c3_arith"
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b28",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "It's *arithmetic*.",
     "shot": "c3_arith",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ding",
       "w:arithmetic",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b29",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Russia was too big and too empty, and the state's answer was to make sure *nobody* left.",
     "shot": "c3_arith"
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b30",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Then came Peter the *Great*.",
     "shot": "c3_peter",
     "date": 1689,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "drum",
       "w:Peter",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b31",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "An *enormous* man, around six feet eight, with an enormous appetite for change.",
     "shot": "c3_peter",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "boing",
       "w:eight",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b32",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "In 1697, he toured Europe *incognito* and worked in a Dutch shipyard to learn shipbuilding himself.",
     "shot": "c3_shipyard",
     "date": 1697,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "clang",
       "w:shipyard",
       0.3
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b33",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "He came home to rebuild the army and *navy*.",
     "shot": "c3_navy",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "whoosh",
       "w:navy",
       0.3
      ]
     ],
     "amb": "waves"
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b34",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "He forced Russia's elite to adopt *Western* ways,",
     "shot": "c3_beards",
     "date": 1698
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b35",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "even ordering nobles to *shave* their beards.",
     "shot": "c3_beards",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "slide_down",
       "w:beards",
       0.5
      ]
     ],
     "gag": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b36",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "He also wanted a *window* onto the sea.",
     "shot": "c3_window",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop",
       "w:window",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b37",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "In 1703, he began building a new capital on the *Baltic* coast.",
     "shot": "c3_swamp",
     "date": 1703,
     "amb": "wind"
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b38",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "On a *swamp*.",
     "shot": "c3_swamp",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "slide_down",
       "w:swamp",
       0.4
      ]
     ],
     "amb": "wind"
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b39",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Tens of thousands of *conscripted* labourers worked on it,",
     "shot": "c3_swamp",
     "amb": "wind",
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b40",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "and many *died* of disease and exhaustion.",
     "shot": "c3_swamp",
     "amb": "wind",
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b41",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "The city that rose was St.",
     "shot": "c3_swamp",
     "amb": "wind"
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b42",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "*Petersburg*.",
     "shot": "c3_swamp",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ding",
       "w:Petersburg",
       0.4
      ]
     ],
     "amb": "wind"
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b43",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "It was Russia's pattern in *miniature*.",
     "shot": "c3_pattern"
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b44",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "A glittering result, paid for with human *lives*.",
     "shot": "c3_pattern"
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}